1
00:01:06,199 --> 00:01:07,701
I read the journal.

2
00:01:07,992 --> 00:01:10,203
Everything about the exhibit.

3
00:01:10,203 --> 00:01:11,830
Everything you've done
for me. Everything...

4
00:01:11,830 --> 00:01:13,957
Everything I don't remember.
I read it all.

5
00:01:13,957 --> 00:01:15,917
Kuya, I think she really regrets it.

6
00:01:15,917 --> 00:01:18,169
She’s been here all day
waiting for you.

7
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:19,462
That's her choice, bro.

8
00:01:20,171 --> 00:01:22,424
I'm just worried something
might trigger her.

9
00:01:22,674 --> 00:01:25,760
I only did what I thought was right

10
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:27,595
and what was best for all of us.

11
00:01:27,846 --> 00:01:28,638
Well, no.

12
00:01:28,888 --> 00:01:30,306
And it's none of your business,

13
00:01:30,306 --> 00:01:32,684
I don't need you because
this is my life!

14
00:01:32,851 --> 00:01:33,601
It's you!

15
00:01:35,019 --> 00:01:35,729
What? Me?

16
00:01:35,979 --> 00:01:36,730
The crazy girl.

17
00:01:36,771 --> 00:01:38,231
Estong, I need your help!

18
00:01:38,523 --> 00:01:41,609
- Ma'am, can you try it imitating her?
- I don't know where Belle went.

19
00:01:41,609 --> 00:01:43,403
I've been wanting to do this
to you for a long time.

20
00:01:45,613 --> 00:01:47,240
What? Got something to say?!

21
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:47,949
Speak up!

22
00:01:48,324 --> 00:01:49,576
You're really losing your mind!

23
00:01:49,743 --> 00:01:50,452
Are you okay?

24
00:01:50,994 --> 00:01:51,911
Don't you worry.

25
00:01:52,537 --> 00:01:54,289
I'm here now, okay?

26
00:01:54,456 --> 00:01:56,207
We're going to see Dr. Wanda.

27
00:01:56,875 --> 00:01:59,294
- Stop it, stop the car!
- Belle. Belle!

28
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,921
Estong! Estong,

29
00:02:01,921 --> 00:02:04,215
no! Estong!

30
00:03:25,463 --> 00:03:26,214
Estong!

31
00:03:26,214 --> 00:03:27,674
- Estong, stop the car!
- Belle!

32
00:03:27,674 --> 00:03:29,634
Ricardo, I said let me
and my daughter out!

33
00:03:39,811 --> 00:03:41,938
Mommy! Daddy...

34
00:03:41,938 --> 00:03:42,814
Estong!

35
00:03:42,814 --> 00:03:45,733
Estong, no! Estong!

36
00:03:55,159 --> 00:03:57,495
Belle, sweetie? Belle!

37
00:03:57,495 --> 00:04:01,249
- Sweetheart, what's happening?
- Belle?

38
00:04:04,377 --> 00:04:06,337
Estong, I'm sorry. It's all my fault.

39
00:04:06,374 --> 00:04:08,795
Everything that happened
to you was my fault.

40
00:04:08,820 --> 00:04:10,446
- I'm so sorry!
- Sweetheart...

41
00:04:10,758 --> 00:04:14,470
Sweetheart...nobody wanted
this to happen. It was an accident.

42
00:04:14,470 --> 00:04:17,515
- None of it was your fault.
- Nang, it's all my fault!

43
00:04:17,515 --> 00:04:20,560
It’s my fault. Why didn’t you
just report me?!

44
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,604
Why didn’t you just take me to the police?

45
00:04:22,604 --> 00:04:23,980
Why?!

46
00:04:25,356 --> 00:04:26,566
Sweetheart...

47
00:04:26,566 --> 00:04:28,026
Estong is getting better now.

48
00:04:28,359 --> 00:04:29,569
He's already recovering.

49
00:04:30,111 --> 00:04:33,239
- Let's just wait for him to wake up.
- But what...what....what if he doesn't?!

50
00:04:33,239 --> 00:04:34,908
What if suddenly something happens to him?!

51
00:04:34,908 --> 00:04:38,077
What if he suddenly develops
complications, Nong?!

52
00:04:40,747 --> 00:04:41,664
Sweetie, that's enough.

53
00:04:41,998 --> 00:04:45,585
It's all my fault. Can't you see that?

54
00:04:45,585 --> 00:04:49,213
No matter what I do, I'm not normal!

55
00:04:49,213 --> 00:04:52,508
Something's wrong with me. I'm not normal!

56
00:04:52,508 --> 00:04:55,261
Everything becomes complicated.

57
00:04:55,261 --> 00:04:58,222
What should I do?

58
00:05:01,768 --> 00:05:05,271
- I can't do this anymore!
- Belle...

59
00:05:07,398 --> 00:05:09,442
I can't do this anymore...

60
00:05:09,442 --> 00:05:12,195
no matter what I do.

61
00:05:13,404 --> 00:05:15,073
That's...That's enough, Belle.

62
00:05:16,199 --> 00:05:17,450
Please, enough.

63
00:05:18,910 --> 00:05:21,412
I keep trying, right?

64
00:05:21,412 --> 00:05:24,290
I keep trying to be normal...

65
00:05:24,290 --> 00:05:28,086
but no, I'm cursed!

66
00:05:28,086 --> 00:05:31,506
- We're all cursed!
- Sweetheart, no.

67
00:05:31,506 --> 00:05:33,967
That's enough.
No, that's not true.

68
00:05:35,802 --> 00:05:37,637
I'm tired, Nang.

69
00:05:38,346 --> 00:05:41,057
Nong, I'm so, so tired.

70
00:05:41,057 --> 00:05:42,517
I can't do this anymore.

71
00:05:42,517 --> 00:05:46,229
- I'm so, so tired.
- Sweetie...that's enough.

72
00:05:46,229 --> 00:05:48,314
That's enough, sweetie, please.

73
00:06:09,002 --> 00:06:11,170
I can't do this anymore. I'm so tired.

74
00:06:11,170 --> 00:06:13,589
- I don't want to be a burden anymore.
- Belle...sweetheart.

75
00:06:13,589 --> 00:06:15,174
- Sweetheart, that's enough...
- Sweetie, come here.

76
00:06:15,174 --> 00:06:17,468
- Sweetie?
- Belle?

77
00:06:18,370 --> 00:06:19,278
Belle!

78
00:06:19,692 --> 00:06:20,606
- Belle!
- Belle!

79
00:06:21,420 --> 00:06:22,543
Belle!

80
00:06:23,141 --> 00:06:24,017
Sweetheart.

81
00:06:24,809 --> 00:06:25,476
Belle?

82
00:06:27,812 --> 00:06:28,771
Belle!

83
00:06:41,325 --> 00:06:42,035
Doc...

84
00:06:42,827 --> 00:06:43,703
is she okay?

85
00:06:44,537 --> 00:06:45,580
Stable...

86
00:06:45,872 --> 00:06:46,914
but I am worried.

87
00:06:47,498 --> 00:06:50,043
It seems like the stress was too
much for her body.

88
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:53,755
That’s why I want to see how
she is when she wakes up.

89
00:06:54,464 --> 00:06:55,423
Why, Doc?

90
00:06:55,923 --> 00:06:58,634
We all know Belle's condition.

91
00:06:59,218 --> 00:07:03,181
When she's going through
something difficult, her D.I.D. may react.

92
00:07:03,765 --> 00:07:04,974
What kind of reaction?

93
00:07:05,224 --> 00:07:06,934
There may be no changes.

94
00:07:07,602 --> 00:07:09,062
But it's possible that

95
00:07:09,062 --> 00:07:11,898
one personality may start
appearing more frequently,

96
00:07:12,190 --> 00:07:13,900
or perhaps...

97
00:07:14,442 --> 00:07:17,153
someone we haven't met
before may appear.

98
00:07:20,323 --> 00:07:21,032
Doc...

99
00:07:21,449 --> 00:07:22,492
there are others?

100
00:07:22,909 --> 00:07:23,868
It's possible.

101
00:07:24,535 --> 00:07:27,080
So I recommend that she undergo

102
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:30,124
an intensive, trauma-focused
treatment program.

103
00:07:30,625 --> 00:07:33,920
That way, we can talk to
her more frequently...

104
00:07:34,337 --> 00:07:35,797
monitor her more closely...

105
00:07:36,172 --> 00:07:38,049
and help her

106
00:07:38,205 --> 00:07:39,331
with whatever...

107
00:07:39,503 --> 00:07:41,297
deep trauma she's carrying.

108
00:07:59,904 --> 00:08:02,573
Belle, you don't have
to take all the blame.

109
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:04,617
It's also our fault.

110
00:08:07,829 --> 00:08:09,288
But then again, it's true...

111
00:08:09,872 --> 00:08:11,582
if she had accepted us back then,

112
00:08:12,041 --> 00:08:13,793
Estong wouldn't have gotten hurt.

113
00:08:14,961 --> 00:08:15,920
Tristan...

114
00:08:16,170 --> 00:08:17,296
Children,

115
00:08:17,296 --> 00:08:18,756
enough with the blaming.

116
00:08:19,799 --> 00:08:21,759
What was meant to happen
has already happened.

117
00:08:22,844 --> 00:08:24,011
What matters is...

118
00:08:24,595 --> 00:08:26,305
we're all still alive.

119
00:08:31,936 --> 00:08:34,063
Where’s my best friend, Estong?

120
00:08:34,313 --> 00:08:36,149
I want us to play again.

121
00:08:37,191 --> 00:08:37,942
Ah...

122
00:08:38,192 --> 00:08:41,320
Yeye, Estong's still in the hospital.

123
00:08:41,612 --> 00:08:42,989
He's still recovering.

124
00:08:43,447 --> 00:08:44,615
Let's go!

125
00:08:44,615 --> 00:08:46,075
Let's visit him.

126
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:49,120
Sure, but next time, okay?

127
00:08:49,412 --> 00:08:52,123
Belle needs to rest too.

128
00:08:52,623 --> 00:08:54,500
We'll visit him together.

129
00:08:55,793 --> 00:08:56,460
Belle...

130
00:08:57,962 --> 00:08:59,130
stay strong.

131
00:08:59,422 --> 00:09:01,424
This is not the time to give up.

132
00:09:02,175 --> 00:09:04,385
Yeah! Be strong, my play mate.

133
00:09:05,136 --> 00:09:08,014
Please listen to us, dear.

134
00:09:08,014 --> 00:09:11,350
Belle, how many times have I told you...

135
00:09:11,350 --> 00:09:12,894
Yeah, listen.

136
00:09:14,187 --> 00:09:14,937
Belle...

137
00:09:15,521 --> 00:09:16,647
just keep on listening.

138
00:09:18,566 --> 00:09:19,400
Belle...

139
00:09:20,234 --> 00:09:21,694
just calm down, okay?

140
00:09:22,069 --> 00:09:23,362
Shut up!

141
00:09:24,113 --> 00:09:25,198
- Ate Belle!
- Belle, why?

142
00:09:25,198 --> 00:09:26,949
Shut up, all of you!

143
00:09:31,662 --> 00:09:33,539
- Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!
- What are you doing?

144
00:09:33,539 --> 00:09:34,916
- Don’t do that, Belle.
- No!

145
00:09:35,458 --> 00:09:37,376
Don't! Ate Belle, don't!

146
00:09:37,627 --> 00:09:38,336
wait...

147
00:09:38,336 --> 00:09:40,963
Hey, hey, hey, wait...

148
00:09:42,006 --> 00:09:43,299
- Don't do it.
- Ate Belle.

149
00:09:43,299 --> 00:09:45,051
- Please, just think about it carefully.
- No!

150
00:09:48,638 --> 00:09:50,223
Belle, what have you done?!

151
00:09:50,765 --> 00:09:52,850
Just like what I said to Estong...

152
00:09:53,726 --> 00:09:56,312
you'll never see the outside world again.

153
00:09:58,689 --> 00:10:00,441
Especially you, Ysa.

154
00:10:03,778 --> 00:10:04,570
Belle!

155
00:10:04,712 --> 00:10:06,285
Belle! Come back here, Belle!

156
00:10:09,659 --> 00:10:12,453
I'm getting claustrophobic!

157
00:10:12,453 --> 00:10:14,497
I cannot, like...

158
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:16,916
We won’t be able to go out anymore?

159
00:10:17,250 --> 00:10:19,001
No, Yeye doesn't like that!

160
00:10:19,001 --> 00:10:21,379
Belle, come on! I don't like this.

161
00:10:32,139 --> 00:10:33,015
Belle?

162
00:10:34,511 --> 00:10:35,268
Belle?

163
00:10:35,664 --> 00:10:36,510
Sweetheart?

164
00:10:37,395 --> 00:10:38,276
Nang...

165
00:10:39,021 --> 00:10:39,814
Sweetie?

166
00:10:39,954 --> 00:10:41,831
Belle, are you okay?

167
00:10:43,067 --> 00:10:44,026
Estong...

168
00:10:46,654 --> 00:10:48,906
Where's Estong? I want to see him.

169
00:11:06,465 --> 00:11:07,508
For you.

170
00:11:10,595 --> 00:11:11,429
Thank you.

171
00:11:14,181 --> 00:11:15,391
Wow!

172
00:11:18,769 --> 00:11:21,230
- Wow, this looks delicious!
- Yeah, it looks good.

173
00:11:22,148 --> 00:11:24,275
Hey, hey, hey, why— don't...

174
00:11:24,275 --> 00:11:26,694
Don't eat that. That's for Estong.

175
00:11:27,945 --> 00:11:30,698
But Pops, there are three of these.
And Kuya is asleep.

176
00:11:30,698 --> 00:11:32,241
What? Is this supposed to go in his IV?

177
00:11:32,575 --> 00:11:33,367
Ah...

178
00:11:35,411 --> 00:11:37,747
- Come on, Pops. Let's eat this already.
- Alright, alright, uh...

179
00:11:37,747 --> 00:11:40,249
- It might melt. I'll go ahead, okay?
- You go ahead, I'll follow later.

180
00:11:40,583 --> 00:11:43,252
- The Pistachio is mine.
- No. Okay, then.

181
00:11:46,339 --> 00:11:47,048
Uh...

182
00:11:47,048 --> 00:11:47,882
Belle...

183
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,469
I just want you to know that...

184
00:11:52,345 --> 00:11:53,888
this isn't your fault.

185
00:11:54,472 --> 00:11:55,389
Okay?

186
00:11:58,392 --> 00:11:59,685
Go on, go to him.

187
00:11:59,977 --> 00:12:01,562
He really needs you.

188
00:12:05,191 --> 00:12:06,296
Thank you.

189
00:12:29,548 --> 00:12:33,594
They say talking can
help with the recovery.

190
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:38,099
But I don't know...

191
00:12:38,338 --> 00:12:40,090
what to say to you.

192
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:42,937
Maybe just some memories?

193
00:12:45,911 --> 00:12:48,372
But let's not talk about my memories.

194
00:12:52,558 --> 00:12:55,217
Maybe just the memories
of my other personalities.

195
00:13:02,039 --> 00:13:03,916
You know, I don't really like reading this.

196
00:13:06,752 --> 00:13:09,046
I don't want to know what they did.

197
00:13:10,589 --> 00:13:13,008
But if it'll help with your recovery...

198
00:13:14,718 --> 00:13:15,761
I'll do it.

199
00:13:18,013 --> 00:13:19,473
What do you want to talk about?

200
00:13:22,810 --> 00:13:24,395
I'll just pick randomly.

201
00:13:36,657 --> 00:13:37,700
Ysa's entry.

202
00:13:41,454 --> 00:13:42,329
She said...

203
00:13:48,335 --> 00:13:51,046
"Today was my first review
session with Estong

204
00:13:51,046 --> 00:13:53,424
for his board exam in Accountacy."

205
00:13:55,134 --> 00:13:56,177
Let's start. What...

206
00:13:56,177 --> 00:13:59,388
do you mean by obligation to do
and obligation to deliver?

207
00:13:59,388 --> 00:14:01,557
I feel like I have an obligation to

208
00:14:01,557 --> 00:14:04,059
stay by your side so you don't fall asleep

209
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:05,895
while we study.

210
00:14:07,688 --> 00:14:10,399
“He kept saying over and
over that he was struggling...”

211
00:14:11,567 --> 00:14:12,610
“That he was confused...”

212
00:14:13,819 --> 00:14:17,865
“But despite all that, I never once saw
or even heard him give up.”

213
00:14:20,701 --> 00:14:23,120
"Estong isn't just determined
with his studies..."

214
00:14:24,705 --> 00:14:25,831
"but with people, too."

215
00:14:27,208 --> 00:14:28,334
"Especially with all of us."

216
00:14:30,044 --> 00:14:32,421
"Every personality he met..."

217
00:14:34,048 --> 00:14:35,591
"he wasn't afraid of,"

218
00:14:37,134 --> 00:14:38,719
"and he didn't give up on."

219
00:14:40,846 --> 00:14:42,973
"He went along with Cacai's antics..."

220
00:14:43,557 --> 00:14:45,935
Yes! Oh my God, that's your angle!

221
00:14:46,727 --> 00:14:48,395
There! Just like that.

222
00:14:48,395 --> 00:14:50,314
Pose some more. There you go!

223
00:14:51,398 --> 00:14:53,651
"He listened as Tristan
shared his sorrows..."

224
00:14:53,901 --> 00:14:55,361
I just want to be happy.

225
00:14:57,196 --> 00:14:59,281
You bring out the best of us.

226
00:14:59,990 --> 00:15:01,909
"He played around with Yeye..."

227
00:15:02,201 --> 00:15:04,328
- Wow!
- So pretty!

228
00:15:04,328 --> 00:15:06,872
Yeye wants a medal!

229
00:15:07,623 --> 00:15:09,625
Kuya Estong? Are we best friends now?

230
00:15:09,625 --> 00:15:10,960
- Oh, sure!
- Pinky swear?

231
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:11,961
Pinky swear!

232
00:15:12,836 --> 00:15:14,838
"He respected Lola Iska..."

233
00:15:15,130 --> 00:15:17,299
Am I getting too heavy for you, dear?

234
00:15:17,550 --> 00:15:19,718
You can stay there as long as you want.

235
00:15:20,219 --> 00:15:22,471
You haven't properly greeted me yet.

236
00:15:29,019 --> 00:15:31,230
"He bore the brunt of Bogart's temper..."

237
00:15:32,022 --> 00:15:34,233
- Didn't I tell you to pose properly?!
- Wait, ow, ouch.

238
00:15:38,529 --> 00:15:40,155
Bogart, no, no, no, no, no...

239
00:15:40,155 --> 00:15:42,449
You might hurt yourself and the others.

240
00:15:45,911 --> 00:15:48,831
"And even though we pushed him
away over and over..."

241
00:15:50,958 --> 00:15:52,501
"he would always come back."

242
00:15:56,046 --> 00:15:57,339
"Over and over..."

243
00:15:59,842 --> 00:16:02,011
"not because he was stubborn,"

244
00:16:05,431 --> 00:16:08,684
"but because he chose not
to give up on us."

245
00:16:11,812 --> 00:16:16,233
"When we're apart, I watch
the videos of us together."

246
00:16:27,202 --> 00:16:30,289
That's the person who helped us.

247
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,043
Woah!

248
00:16:34,752 --> 00:16:36,962
Just...just relax, Bogart. Just relax.

249
00:16:40,591 --> 00:16:42,468
You're my best friend, Yeye!

250
00:16:42,718 --> 00:16:45,095
We're best friends now, Yeye. Okay?

251
00:16:47,598 --> 00:16:49,767
No homo, bro. No homo...

252
00:16:51,435 --> 00:16:52,895
Lola Iska!

253
00:16:53,687 --> 00:16:55,022
Wake up, wake up.

254
00:16:56,273 --> 00:16:57,775
Clo...clock it,

255
00:16:58,609 --> 00:17:00,402
clock it...cloc...

256
00:17:07,701 --> 00:17:09,995
Weighted Average Cost.

257
00:17:10,454 --> 00:17:13,248
Computes an active
average cost per unit

258
00:17:13,248 --> 00:17:15,250
based on total cost of goods available

259
00:17:15,250 --> 00:17:17,252
divided by the total units.

260
00:17:25,177 --> 00:17:25,928
Ysa...

261
00:17:26,762 --> 00:17:27,596
thank you.

262
00:17:30,182 --> 00:17:31,225
It's nothing.

263
00:17:31,767 --> 00:17:32,518
And besides,

264
00:17:32,768 --> 00:17:34,770
this is nothing compared
to what you did for me.

265
00:17:37,106 --> 00:17:37,981
Well...

266
00:17:39,942 --> 00:17:40,734
not just with this.

267
00:17:42,277 --> 00:17:43,696
Thank you, because...

268
00:17:45,322 --> 00:17:48,450
you all helped me change
the way I see myself.

269
00:17:51,245 --> 00:17:52,538
Because honestly,

270
00:17:53,914 --> 00:17:54,873
I was already about to give up.

271
00:17:57,626 --> 00:17:59,002
And then you guys came along.

272
00:18:01,296 --> 00:18:03,757
I felt like I was a blank canvas.

273
00:18:04,717 --> 00:18:05,759
Nothing at all.

274
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:07,302
No direction.

275
00:18:11,348 --> 00:18:12,891
All of you gave my life color.

276
00:18:15,185 --> 00:18:16,186
Because of that...

277
00:18:20,691 --> 00:18:22,276
I gave myself a chance.

278
00:18:25,195 --> 00:18:26,029
Thank you...

279
00:18:26,488 --> 00:18:27,865
because all of you never gave up on me.

280
00:18:34,997 --> 00:18:37,207
I promise I'll be here for all of you..

281
00:18:37,583 --> 00:18:38,459
always.

282
00:18:39,918 --> 00:18:41,253
I won't give up on all of you either.

283
00:18:50,512 --> 00:18:53,599
You know, I also used to think
you were just stubborn.

284
00:18:55,184 --> 00:18:57,519
I also used to think you were
just being annoying.

285
00:19:01,774 --> 00:19:03,066
But I was wrong.

286
00:19:08,197 --> 00:19:10,866
You really made an effort
to get to know me.

287
00:19:15,329 --> 00:19:18,248
Even after all the times
I pushed you away...

288
00:19:19,041 --> 00:19:19,917
You know me?

289
00:19:19,917 --> 00:19:21,418
You're the one who almost kissed me, right?

290
00:19:21,418 --> 00:19:24,046
I said, don't follow me!

291
00:19:24,296 --> 00:19:25,339
Why are you still here?

292
00:19:25,339 --> 00:19:26,423
Aren't you leaving yet?

293
00:19:27,090 --> 00:19:28,550
Lorenz and I are fine here.

294
00:19:29,218 --> 00:19:31,553
But it’s still different when you
have someone to share your life with.

295
00:19:31,553 --> 00:19:32,888
Someone who also has direction.

296
00:19:32,888 --> 00:19:34,473
Unlike some people who just...

297
00:19:34,807 --> 00:19:37,434
hang around while doing nothing.

298
00:19:37,935 --> 00:19:39,603
Oh, you know what? That's true.

299
00:19:40,354 --> 00:19:42,272
Even though I'm such a mess,

300
00:19:44,733 --> 00:19:47,861
even though I'm so hard to deal with...

301
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:51,532
you didn't give up.

302
00:19:52,282 --> 00:19:53,826
I'm here to ask you out, Belle.

303
00:19:55,994 --> 00:19:57,037
And I'm serious about it!

304
00:20:03,585 --> 00:20:05,420
You never left me.

305
00:20:06,463 --> 00:20:07,881
- Please, stop. Please.
- Belle! Belle! That's enough!

306
00:20:07,881 --> 00:20:09,049
- Huh? Huh?!
- Belle, that's enough.

307
00:20:09,716 --> 00:20:10,634
Don't you worry.

308
00:20:11,301 --> 00:20:13,053
I'm here now, okay?

309
00:20:55,762 --> 00:20:58,515
Estong, you're not the one
who needs to disappear.

310
00:21:11,695 --> 00:21:12,696
Hey, Alora.

311
00:21:12,988 --> 00:21:16,283
- Which one did you say would suit me?
- This will do right? This will do.

312
00:21:20,746 --> 00:21:21,622
So...

313
00:21:24,958 --> 00:21:26,043
When...

314
00:21:26,043 --> 00:21:28,337
are we gonna make it official, hmm?

315
00:21:29,922 --> 00:21:32,007
You know? You're always such
a main character.

316
00:21:32,633 --> 00:21:33,926
Have you even proposed yet?

317
00:21:34,593 --> 00:21:35,344
And besides...

318
00:21:35,456 --> 00:21:37,332
are we even an item?
What's our label?

319
00:21:39,598 --> 00:21:40,390
You know what...

320
00:21:40,390 --> 00:21:41,516
you're right.

321
00:21:42,851 --> 00:21:44,978
We're basically just in a situationship.

322
00:21:45,771 --> 00:21:46,980
It's because you got an attitude.

323
00:21:47,551 --> 00:21:49,136
Wow... me? Really?

324
00:21:49,441 --> 00:21:50,783
Look who's talking.

325
00:21:55,489 --> 00:21:57,824
- We can't find Belle!
- Have you seen her?

326
00:21:57,824 --> 00:22:00,786
We've been calling her all day, but
we haven't been able to reach her.

327
00:22:00,786 --> 00:22:02,412
She hasn't gotten in touch with us.

328
00:22:02,412 --> 00:22:04,373
What could've happened to her?

329
00:22:04,373 --> 00:22:05,290
Maybe she got kidnapped.

330
00:22:05,499 --> 00:22:06,750
Do you want me to call the police?

331
00:22:07,376 --> 00:22:08,126
Maybe...

332
00:22:08,126 --> 00:22:10,462
- maybe there's a new personality!
- Oh, I hope not!

333
00:22:10,462 --> 00:22:13,215
- OMG!
- Aunties, you're not helping.

334
00:22:13,215 --> 00:22:15,634
- Right. You're not.
- Wait a minute. Just wait, okay?

335
00:22:16,009 --> 00:22:17,052
Everyone, just relax. Relax.

336
00:22:17,649 --> 00:22:18,442
Just relax, okay?

337
00:22:18,616 --> 00:22:19,533
Let's just relax.

338
00:22:21,223 --> 00:22:23,016
- What?
- Love, just relax.

339
00:22:23,777 --> 00:22:24,819
Relax. Just relax!

340
00:22:25,143 --> 00:22:26,103
He seems relaxed.

341
00:22:26,103 --> 00:22:28,271
- You guys look there!
- Alright, let's go to this side.

342
00:22:28,271 --> 00:22:29,314
Come on, let's go!

343
00:22:29,314 --> 00:22:30,941
- Let's go look for her over there.
- Belle?

344
00:22:31,841 --> 00:22:33,509
Let's just relax! Let's just relax!

345
00:22:34,427 --> 00:22:35,303
Just relax...

346
00:22:36,035 --> 00:22:37,036
Relax.

347
00:23:04,307 --> 00:23:06,810
Seriously? I can't even track Ate Belle.

348
00:23:07,185 --> 00:23:08,520
Where are you?

349
00:23:12,107 --> 00:23:13,233
What's the news, Capt.?

350
00:23:14,192 --> 00:23:15,777
No one has seen her, sir.

351
00:23:17,070 --> 00:23:20,282
We've already asked around
at almost all the terminals,

352
00:23:20,282 --> 00:23:22,951
eateries, and stores around here.

353
00:23:22,951 --> 00:23:25,829
Even in the neighboring barangays,
she's nowhere to be found.

354
00:23:26,371 --> 00:23:28,415
- How about we call the police already?
- Yeah!

355
00:23:28,707 --> 00:23:30,083
I already called them earlier.

356
00:23:31,668 --> 00:23:33,170
So, what did they say, Kent?

357
00:23:33,170 --> 00:23:36,006
They said Belle can't be considered missing

358
00:23:36,006 --> 00:23:38,133
until 24 hours have passed.

359
00:23:38,759 --> 00:23:40,177
How is she not a missing person?

360
00:23:40,552 --> 00:23:42,596
We don't even know where she is.

361
00:23:43,347 --> 00:23:44,931
That's just how the protocol works.

362
00:23:45,390 --> 00:23:48,185
Ninong, Ate Belle's situation is different.

363
00:23:48,769 --> 00:23:49,561
You know,

364
00:23:49,770 --> 00:23:51,480
she doesn't have her medication with her,

365
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:53,815
or anything she can
use to calm herself down.

366
00:23:54,024 --> 00:23:55,609
And we're not there with her.

367
00:23:55,609 --> 00:23:56,818
What are we supposed to do?

368
00:23:57,277 --> 00:23:58,320
Don't worry.

369
00:23:58,820 --> 00:24:00,989
Even though she hasn't officially been
reported missing yet,

370
00:24:01,239 --> 00:24:02,824
we can still help look for her.

371
00:24:03,492 --> 00:24:04,701
Thank you so much, Cap.

372
00:24:04,701 --> 00:24:06,203
- Thank you so much.
- Please help us.

373
00:24:06,203 --> 00:24:08,830
My God, where is Belle?
What's happening to her?

374
00:24:09,998 --> 00:24:11,750
- Wait. Maybe them. We can give these out.
- Okay, okay.

375
00:24:17,297 --> 00:24:17,817
Mister, here.

376
00:24:17,841 --> 00:24:19,424
Maybe you can help us
find her, if you know anything.

377
00:24:19,424 --> 00:24:20,217
Mister...

378
00:24:20,717 --> 00:24:22,302
Have you seen
her? She's missing.

379
00:24:37,692 --> 00:24:38,485
Estong?

380
00:24:38,485 --> 00:24:39,277
Son!

381
00:24:42,864 --> 00:24:43,949
Oh, Kuya.

382
00:24:44,366 --> 00:24:47,244
I thought I was going
to inherit Popsy's business.

383
00:24:47,619 --> 00:24:48,495
What's wrong with you?

384
00:24:49,371 --> 00:24:51,164
He ate all your Yogorino.

385
00:24:51,414 --> 00:24:52,124
Pops.

386
00:24:56,419 --> 00:24:57,462
Belle...

387
00:24:58,421 --> 00:24:59,464
Where's Belle?

388
00:25:13,270 --> 00:25:14,312
Anything there?

389
00:25:15,188 --> 00:25:15,981
Nothing.

390
00:25:23,071 --> 00:25:23,864
Kuya,

391
00:25:24,188 --> 00:25:27,534
I'll go see Pops for a bit, okay? We
just need to sort out the discharge papers.

392
00:25:28,577 --> 00:25:29,578
Alright.

393
00:25:47,285 --> 00:25:48,227
It's Estong.

394
00:25:48,996 --> 00:25:49,883
Estong!

395
00:25:50,032 --> 00:25:51,600
- Tita Barbs, Tito Kent.
- How are you feeling?

396
00:25:51,600 --> 00:25:52,642
We're so glad you're awake.

397
00:25:52,973 --> 00:25:55,017
Yeah, Estong. Why did you call us?

398
00:25:55,267 --> 00:25:56,894
Aren't you supposed to be resting?

399
00:25:58,106 --> 00:25:59,149
Uh...

400
00:25:59,608 --> 00:26:01,526
Can I talk to Belle?

401
00:26:03,028 --> 00:26:03,904
Um...

402
00:26:04,488 --> 00:26:05,864
Belle's missing.

403
00:26:09,201 --> 00:26:10,577
How...how is she missing?

404
00:26:10,785 --> 00:26:12,662
That's why we're here in her room,

405
00:26:12,662 --> 00:26:16,333
looking for any clues that might help us
figure out where she went.

406
00:26:16,583 --> 00:26:18,335
We've been looking for her all day.

407
00:26:18,335 --> 00:26:21,796
We've already checked every place
she could possibly have gone.

408
00:26:21,796 --> 00:26:23,089
But nothing. No luck.

409
00:26:23,340 --> 00:26:26,593
Yeah. We're just waiting here for now
to see what happens.

410
00:26:26,995 --> 00:26:28,872
Uh...I'll go look for Belle, Tita.

411
00:26:29,172 --> 00:26:31,800
Oh, Estong, thank you, but...

412
00:26:31,830 --> 00:26:33,123
we'll take care of it, okay?

413
00:26:33,148 --> 00:26:35,567
What's important now is
that you get better.

414
00:26:35,894 --> 00:26:38,271
Yeah, Estong, just get some rest.
You might strain yourself.

415
00:26:38,271 --> 00:26:39,356
We'll handle things for now.

416
00:26:39,846 --> 00:26:40,638
Uh...

417
00:26:40,903 --> 00:26:41,696
Tita...

418
00:26:42,776 --> 00:26:44,861
May I ask where

419
00:26:45,445 --> 00:26:47,197
the house in Belle’s painting is located?

420
00:26:48,198 --> 00:26:49,241
- House?
- Painting?

421
00:26:51,368 --> 00:26:52,202
This one?

422
00:26:54,045 --> 00:26:58,216
In Ysa's case, she has created
a world inside her mind.

423
00:26:58,500 --> 00:27:00,543
Based on Ysa's description...

424
00:27:01,370 --> 00:27:04,248
this looks like the house she grew up in.

425
00:27:04,273 --> 00:27:05,732
Only safer.

426
00:27:47,924 --> 00:27:49,592
You're seeing another woman!

427
00:27:49,592 --> 00:27:50,677
Stop it!

428
00:27:50,677 --> 00:27:51,761
What's wrong with you?

429
00:28:04,764 --> 00:28:07,528
- No! We're leaving you!
- No... she's not coming with you!

430
00:28:07,553 --> 00:28:08,888
- I'm taking her with me!
- She's staying here at home!

431
00:28:21,617 --> 00:28:23,944
- I saw it! Just admit it!
- No!

432
00:28:24,127 --> 00:28:25,225
You're not going to admit it?!

433
00:28:28,921 --> 00:28:31,381
Ricardo, Iet me and my daughter out!

434
00:28:34,527 --> 00:28:35,612
Mommy...

435
00:28:38,808 --> 00:28:39,893
Let's play!

436
00:28:39,893 --> 00:28:41,227
No! You're crazy!

437
00:28:41,478 --> 00:28:43,563
Ysabelle is really sad,

438
00:28:43,813 --> 00:28:45,315
so I'm keeping her company.

439
00:28:54,908 --> 00:28:56,368
This is what you all wanted, right?

440
00:28:58,244 --> 00:28:59,954
For all of us to be together?

441
00:28:59,954 --> 00:29:02,415
Fine, then. I’ll give you exactly that!

442
00:29:05,210 --> 00:29:08,421
I'm going to make sure that no one else
will get hurt because of us.

443
00:29:09,422 --> 00:29:11,132
Especially Estong!

444
00:29:13,843 --> 00:29:15,387
Belle...

445
00:29:16,304 --> 00:29:17,389
Why are you staring at me?!

446
00:29:17,680 --> 00:29:18,932
- Don't mess with me!
- Belle!

447
00:29:23,561 --> 00:29:24,938
Belle...

448
00:29:24,938 --> 00:29:27,482
It's her! She's the
crazy girl! It's really her!

449
00:29:27,482 --> 00:29:30,110
Stop it! Leave me alone! Leave me alone!

450
00:29:31,111 --> 00:29:32,654
You shameless prick! You bastard!

451
00:29:32,654 --> 00:29:34,030
- Stop it.
- How could you do this to me!

452
00:29:34,030 --> 00:29:34,594
I can't control them.

453
00:29:34,619 --> 00:29:36,656
So many people are making
fun of me because of you!

454
00:29:38,493 --> 00:29:39,994
- Estong, stop the car!
- Belle!

455
00:29:43,409 --> 00:29:44,202
Estong!

456
00:29:44,227 --> 00:29:46,938
Estong, no! Estong!

457
00:30:16,281 --> 00:30:18,283
- What’s wrong with this?
- She tried everything already,

458
00:30:18,283 --> 00:30:21,369
- but see? It’s still broken.
- Hello Mr. Bunny, hello Mr. Cheese!

459
00:30:21,750 --> 00:30:23,413
- I should hit it like this. Tapping it won't work.
- Let's play?

460
00:30:23,413 --> 00:30:25,457
No, we can’t. It’s still broken.

461
00:30:38,887 --> 00:30:40,680
Hi Belle.

462
00:30:50,493 --> 00:30:52,066
- Oh my.
- What was that?

463
00:30:54,694 --> 00:30:56,696
- What happened?
- Yeye scared.

464
00:30:59,491 --> 00:31:00,325
Who are you?

465
00:31:01,201 --> 00:31:02,285
A new alter?

466
00:31:03,786 --> 00:31:05,371
You had to add yourself to the mix, huh?

467
00:31:05,622 --> 00:31:08,266
We’ve known each other for a long time.

468
00:31:08,291 --> 00:31:10,835
I know everything you’ve been through.

469
00:31:11,044 --> 00:31:12,504
You're here to help me?

470
00:31:13,103 --> 00:31:15,230
Well, too late! Because,
I don't need you!

471
00:31:16,466 --> 00:31:19,552
I'm not here to help you like they do.

472
00:31:19,865 --> 00:31:23,321
Because you and I,
we want the same thing.

473
00:31:23,473 --> 00:31:25,308
You know it deep inside, Belle.

474
00:31:25,780 --> 00:31:26,865
What do you mean?

475
00:31:27,967 --> 00:31:28,843
That's up to you.

476
00:31:29,070 --> 00:31:30,738
I won't stop you.

477
00:31:31,105 --> 00:31:33,816
I know how much we've been through.

478
00:31:35,089 --> 00:31:36,125
You don't know anything.

479
00:31:36,536 --> 00:31:37,620
You know nothing!

480
00:31:48,344 --> 00:31:49,624
I know...

481
00:31:50,583 --> 00:31:52,835
how it feels to be abandoned,

482
00:31:53,797 --> 00:31:55,129
to be hurt...

483
00:31:57,215 --> 00:32:00,718
I also know how it feels
to be consumed by regret.

484
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:05,014
It's hard to live in that situation.

485
00:32:05,265 --> 00:32:08,768
And I know you already
know how this will end.

486
00:32:08,977 --> 00:32:11,229
Do you want to end this?

487
00:32:12,939 --> 00:32:14,023
I'm tired.

488
00:32:17,360 --> 00:32:19,988
I’m tired of having to share
my life with them.

489
00:32:21,614 --> 00:32:23,950
It's okay to be tired, Belle.

490
00:32:24,527 --> 00:32:26,028
I understand where you're coming from.

491
00:32:26,536 --> 00:32:28,871
What you’ve been through wasn't normal.

492
00:32:29,497 --> 00:32:31,791
No one deserves a life like that.

493
00:32:32,867 --> 00:32:35,036
I need someone who understands me.

494
00:32:37,672 --> 00:32:39,549
Someone who knows what I need...

495
00:32:41,509 --> 00:32:43,011
not what "we" need.

496
00:32:44,137 --> 00:32:46,014
I understand you.

497
00:32:46,556 --> 00:32:47,932
You need me.

498
00:32:48,433 --> 00:32:49,517
Who are you, really?

499
00:32:50,435 --> 00:32:52,061
You still haven’t told me.

500
00:32:52,478 --> 00:32:54,147
Are you a new alter or not?

501
00:32:55,231 --> 00:32:57,400
I'm not like them.

502
00:32:58,693 --> 00:33:00,862
Like "them", who are ruining my life?

503
00:33:01,779 --> 00:33:04,657
Like "them", who are protecting you.

504
00:33:11,372 --> 00:33:12,874
- Bogart.
- Ysa.

505
00:33:14,083 --> 00:33:15,585
Lola Iska.

506
00:33:33,853 --> 00:33:34,687
Bogart...

507
00:33:38,816 --> 00:33:39,651
Cacai...

508
00:33:41,277 --> 00:33:42,111
Lola?

509
00:33:43,571 --> 00:33:44,364
Lola.

510
00:33:45,156 --> 00:33:45,948
Yeye.

511
00:33:47,784 --> 00:33:48,576
Tristan.

512
00:33:49,827 --> 00:33:50,912
Tristan.

513
00:33:58,586 --> 00:34:00,463
They're all helping you.

514
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:03,758
But only I can give you the solution.

515
00:34:05,677 --> 00:34:06,511
Belle...

516
00:34:06,928 --> 00:34:08,262
I need to go to Belle.

517
00:34:08,805 --> 00:34:10,139
I need to save Belle.

518
00:34:12,517 --> 00:34:13,351
Belle!

519
00:34:15,353 --> 00:34:16,604
That's why I'm here.

520
00:34:17,063 --> 00:34:18,898
I am the release.

521
00:34:19,107 --> 00:34:21,234
I can help set you free...

522
00:34:21,401 --> 00:34:24,612
from everything that's been
troubling your mind.

523
00:34:28,408 --> 00:34:30,618
All my life, I've been struggling.

524
00:34:32,829 --> 00:34:34,539
I even feel like I can't take it anymore.

525
00:34:36,749 --> 00:34:38,334
But I have no choice.

526
00:34:39,043 --> 00:34:40,962
What can you do, right?

527
00:34:41,421 --> 00:34:43,548
This is the life you were given,

528
00:34:43,715 --> 00:34:46,926
but it’s not true that you have
no choice but to accept it.

529
00:34:51,514 --> 00:34:52,598
Come.

530
00:34:53,057 --> 00:34:55,017
Hold my hand.

531
00:34:59,522 --> 00:35:00,314
Belle?

532
00:35:01,315 --> 00:35:02,264
Belle!

533
00:35:04,485 --> 00:35:05,569
Belle!

534
00:35:05,611 --> 00:35:06,616
Belle?

535
00:35:09,574 --> 00:35:10,498
Belle?

536
00:35:15,580 --> 00:35:17,165
If I go with you,

537
00:35:17,498 --> 00:35:18,958
will everything be better?

538
00:35:29,218 --> 00:35:30,052
Belle!

539
00:35:34,724 --> 00:35:35,558
Belle!

540
00:35:37,935 --> 00:35:38,770
Belle!

541
00:35:40,563 --> 00:35:42,190
Belle? Belle!

542
00:35:42,607 --> 00:35:43,441
Belle!

543
00:35:44,650 --> 00:35:45,568
Belle, wake up.

544
00:35:46,778 --> 00:35:48,237
Belle? Belle?

545
00:36:16,349 --> 00:36:17,433
Belle, don't!

546
00:36:18,142 --> 00:36:19,018
What the hell?!

547
00:36:19,698 --> 00:36:21,992
I don’t need any of you!
I don’t need you!

548
00:36:22,355 --> 00:36:24,148
Belle, please. Don't listen to her.

549
00:36:24,148 --> 00:36:25,399
Don't hear her out.

550
00:36:25,691 --> 00:36:26,776
Who should I listen to?

551
00:36:27,151 --> 00:36:27,944
You?

552
00:36:28,694 --> 00:36:30,029
I'm tired of this life.

553
00:36:30,655 --> 00:36:33,908
I'm tired of living a life
shared with all of you!

554
00:36:34,192 --> 00:36:35,026
Belle, please.

555
00:36:35,952 --> 00:36:38,454
That’s not going to make things better.

556
00:36:40,122 --> 00:36:41,207
If I'm gone...

557
00:36:42,250 --> 00:36:43,584
you'll all be gone too.

558
00:36:45,127 --> 00:36:48,047
Our suffering and everyone
else’s will finally end.

559
00:36:48,589 --> 00:36:50,883
We won’t be able to hurt anyone anymore.

560
00:36:51,801 --> 00:36:53,427
You need to make a decision now.

561
00:36:58,808 --> 00:37:00,893
Let's end this, Belle.

562
00:37:10,695 --> 00:37:11,487
Belle...

563
00:37:12,405 --> 00:37:15,032
Belle, Nanang and Nonong
are waiting for you...

564
00:37:16,576 --> 00:37:18,494
along with everyone at Nagkaisang Bayan.

565
00:37:20,204 --> 00:37:20,955
Belle...

566
00:37:21,998 --> 00:37:24,125
Estong. Listen to Estong.

567
00:37:30,548 --> 00:37:31,632
Estong's awake?

568
00:37:35,052 --> 00:37:35,845
Belle?

569
00:37:38,764 --> 00:37:40,308
Belle. Belle, wake up.

570
00:37:40,975 --> 00:37:41,733
Belle...

571
00:37:43,436 --> 00:37:44,812
Belle, the ambulance is coming.

572
00:37:46,564 --> 00:37:48,190
Belle, don't leave me, please.

573
00:37:48,983 --> 00:37:49,817
Belle!

574
00:37:51,527 --> 00:37:52,378
Belle...

575
00:37:52,403 --> 00:37:54,280
Belle, wake up. I'm here now, Belle.

576
00:37:56,032 --> 00:37:56,944
Belle...

577
00:37:57,658 --> 00:37:58,367
Belle!

578
00:37:58,884 --> 00:38:01,595
Ys...Ysabelle, please. Don't leave me.

579
00:38:02,663 --> 00:38:04,332
All of you, please don't leave me.

580
00:38:05,625 --> 00:38:06,584
Belle!

581
00:38:08,753 --> 00:38:10,296
Belle!

582
00:38:10,963 --> 00:38:11,964
Belle, please!

583
00:38:13,909 --> 00:38:16,328
Yeye, we're still going to play, right?
What do you want?

584
00:38:16,990 --> 00:38:19,742
Do you want a lollipop?
Do you want some balloons?

585
00:38:20,973 --> 00:38:23,392
I'll always be here if you want
someone to play with, okay?

586
00:38:24,518 --> 00:38:25,603
Best friend.

587
00:38:26,938 --> 00:38:27,772
Cai...

588
00:38:29,732 --> 00:38:31,108
Cai, we're still going to have
our fashion show, right?

589
00:38:31,108 --> 00:38:33,486
We'll pick out lots of clothes for you.

590
00:38:33,653 --> 00:38:35,071
Please...Cacai!

591
00:38:36,622 --> 00:38:37,998
Jestoni.

592
00:38:41,077 --> 00:38:42,161
Tristan, um...

593
00:38:42,237 --> 00:38:43,679
we're still going to karaoke, right?

594
00:38:43,704 --> 00:38:45,456
Tristan, you said we'd sing together.

595
00:38:45,456 --> 00:38:47,875
I haven't even heard you sing yet, please.

596
00:38:48,292 --> 00:38:50,169
You said you'd make it up to me.

597
00:38:50,962 --> 00:38:51,712
Bro.

598
00:38:54,939 --> 00:38:55,940
Bogart...

599
00:38:56,592 --> 00:38:57,677
Bogart, what do you want?

600
00:38:57,677 --> 00:38:59,178
I can always be your punching bag.

601
00:38:59,178 --> 00:39:00,221
It's fine by me.

602
00:39:00,972 --> 00:39:03,641
Bogart, you can hit me
whenever you want.

603
00:39:05,184 --> 00:39:06,268
Estong.

604
00:39:07,742 --> 00:39:09,160
Lola...Lola Iska!

605
00:39:10,189 --> 00:39:11,816
I'm sorry, I won't forget anymore.

606
00:39:11,816 --> 00:39:12,900
I'll always greet you properly.

607
00:39:12,900 --> 00:39:15,319
I'll always be respectful. I promise, Lola.

608
00:39:15,319 --> 00:39:16,654
Lo...Lola!

609
00:39:18,823 --> 00:39:19,782
My child.

610
00:39:23,869 --> 00:39:25,204
Ysa...

611
00:39:27,498 --> 00:39:29,333
I still don't know how to paint.

612
00:39:29,333 --> 00:39:32,712
My paintings are still terrible.
I can't lose you.

613
00:39:33,963 --> 00:39:35,047
Ysa!

614
00:39:37,049 --> 00:39:38,050
Ysabelle.

615
00:39:47,893 --> 00:39:49,478
Don't leave me!

616
00:39:52,398 --> 00:39:54,358
Please! Wake up.

617
00:39:58,404 --> 00:39:59,186
Belle...

618
00:40:00,906 --> 00:40:02,575
Belle, I believe...

619
00:40:04,326 --> 00:40:06,037
that everything can still be better.

620
00:40:10,124 --> 00:40:12,752
I believe we can still be whole.

621
00:40:14,253 --> 00:40:16,422
The decision is yours.

622
00:40:19,592 --> 00:40:21,093
I'm just right here.

623
00:40:32,123 --> 00:40:33,773
Belle!

624
00:40:58,297 --> 00:40:59,423
Bro...

625
00:40:59,924 --> 00:41:02,218
we're not here to steal your life from you.

626
00:41:03,135 --> 00:41:04,261
We were created

627
00:41:04,637 --> 00:41:07,598
because you could no longer
carry the pain alone.

628
00:41:08,816 --> 00:41:09,900
We're here

629
00:41:10,475 --> 00:41:12,645
to protect you from those
who would hurt you.

630
00:41:14,188 --> 00:41:15,523
But you're the reason....

631
00:41:15,523 --> 00:41:18,192
all of you are the reason
why I'm not normal!

632
00:41:18,609 --> 00:41:21,195
Girl, no. How can you say that?

633
00:41:22,696 --> 00:41:24,406
Trauma is the one to blame.

634
00:41:24,824 --> 00:41:25,741
Not us.

635
00:41:25,908 --> 00:41:29,620
In fact, we are your emergency
response and defense team.

636
00:41:30,162 --> 00:41:31,747
What needs to end

637
00:41:31,747 --> 00:41:33,958
is your belief that we're enemies.

638
00:41:34,625 --> 00:41:36,418
As embarrassing as it is to say...

639
00:41:36,836 --> 00:41:38,212
you're all my best friends.

640
00:41:38,712 --> 00:41:40,965
We're not your enemies, dear.

641
00:41:41,340 --> 00:41:42,967
We are not a curse.

642
00:41:43,342 --> 00:41:47,555
We're the parts of you that have
been trying to love you...

643
00:41:47,972 --> 00:41:50,349
in every way we can.

644
00:41:51,851 --> 00:41:54,520
We love you, Ate Belle!

645
00:42:37,897 --> 00:42:39,982
We love you, Belle.

646
00:43:48,592 --> 00:43:49,426
Belle?

647
00:43:56,100 --> 00:43:57,101
Estong.

648
00:43:59,937 --> 00:44:01,355
Belle, I'm here now.

649
00:44:04,525 --> 00:44:05,734
Estong.

650
00:44:07,486 --> 00:44:08,654
I'm right here.

651
00:44:56,035 --> 00:44:56,869
Hey...

652
00:44:57,619 --> 00:44:59,663
It's...It's Ate.

653
00:45:00,748 --> 00:45:02,166
Estong.

654
00:45:02,333 --> 00:45:03,917
It’s Belle.

655
00:45:05,085 --> 00:45:06,045
Sweetheart.

656
00:45:06,295 --> 00:45:09,173
Thank God, she made it home.

657
00:45:16,263 --> 00:45:17,097
Ate?

658
00:45:19,725 --> 00:45:20,559
Sweetie.

659
00:45:21,101 --> 00:45:21,935
Ate.

660
00:46:03,727 --> 00:46:05,020
I'm glad that you're okay now.

661
00:46:09,441 --> 00:46:10,859
Thank you, Estong.

662
00:46:18,283 --> 00:46:19,827
I hope we're going to be okay, too.

663
00:46:21,203 --> 00:46:22,037
Hmm?

664
00:46:23,247 --> 00:46:24,456
What do you mean?

665
00:46:32,798 --> 00:46:33,757
Belle...

666
00:46:35,050 --> 00:46:36,427
will you be my girlfriend?

667
00:46:43,475 --> 00:46:44,393
Um...

668
00:46:50,357 --> 00:46:51,817
Estong, it's not possible.

669
00:46:53,444 --> 00:46:54,778
Why is it still not possible?

670
00:46:58,240 --> 00:46:59,867
You should still go to Australia.

671
00:47:02,327 --> 00:47:03,745
Then what? I'll just leave you behind?

672
00:47:09,042 --> 00:47:10,627
You're not leaving me.

673
00:47:12,713 --> 00:47:14,673
You'll achieve your dreams.

674
00:47:16,383 --> 00:47:18,427
Belle, you're part of my dreams.

675
00:47:19,183 --> 00:47:22,019
Estong, you helped me
achieve my dreams.

676
00:47:23,591 --> 00:47:25,718
I want to support you, too.

677
00:47:26,817 --> 00:47:30,801
I want to be here for you as
you pursue your dreams.

678
00:47:33,859 --> 00:47:35,068
Even when I'm far away.

679
00:47:41,575 --> 00:47:42,826
Belle, I'm not going.

680
00:47:43,118 --> 00:47:44,328
I'm not leaving you.

681
00:47:46,622 --> 00:47:47,706
I can't leave you.

682
00:47:49,458 --> 00:47:51,335
Let me handle it, Estong.

683
00:47:55,672 --> 00:47:57,883
It's enough for me to
know that you're there...

684
00:48:01,220 --> 00:48:02,930
even when we're far apart.

685
00:48:08,352 --> 00:48:10,604
Maybe this is also your chance...

686
00:48:12,314 --> 00:48:14,691
to find out what you really want, right?

687
00:48:16,860 --> 00:48:18,237
But don't worry.

688
00:48:22,324 --> 00:48:23,909
I'll always be here for you.

689
00:48:36,067 --> 00:48:37,177
You're right.

690
00:48:40,842 --> 00:48:42,094
I know...

691
00:48:42,928 --> 00:48:44,012
you can handle it,

692
00:48:45,889 --> 00:48:47,474
and I can handle it as well.

693
00:49:02,614 --> 00:49:03,824
Goodbye, Estong.

694
00:49:08,225 --> 00:49:09,309
This isn't goodbye.

695
00:49:10,372 --> 00:49:11,426
I'll be back.

696
00:49:12,869 --> 00:49:14,704
I'll come back for you, okay?

697
00:49:16,148 --> 00:49:17,274
I'll be waiting.

698
00:50:02,858 --> 00:50:05,611
And now, let's welcome,

699
00:50:05,636 --> 00:50:07,429
the woman of the hour...

700
00:50:07,554 --> 00:50:10,057
the artist of these masterpieces...

701
00:50:10,349 --> 00:50:12,851
Ms. Ysabelle Navarro.

702
00:50:12,851 --> 00:50:15,395
- Congratulations!
- Congrats, Belle!

703
00:50:16,396 --> 00:50:18,440
Congratulations, Belle!

704
00:50:32,162 --> 00:50:33,789
At first, I thought...

705
00:50:34,498 --> 00:50:37,000
I had to choose who I really was.

706
00:50:38,377 --> 00:50:39,336
I thought...

707
00:50:40,253 --> 00:50:42,381
there were things that had to be gone

708
00:50:42,714 --> 00:50:44,132
for me to become whole.

709
00:50:46,468 --> 00:50:47,719
But I was wrong.

710
00:50:50,430 --> 00:50:51,598
All of them...

711
00:50:53,600 --> 00:50:55,560
are part of who I am today.

712
00:50:58,105 --> 00:50:59,272
Every fear

713
00:50:59,606 --> 00:51:00,857
that I faced,

714
00:51:02,776 --> 00:51:04,861
every wound I endured,

715
00:51:05,988 --> 00:51:07,781
every version of myself

716
00:51:07,989 --> 00:51:09,908
I tried to forget...

717
00:51:13,370 --> 00:51:15,747
All of that, all of them, are a part of me.

718
00:51:20,711 --> 00:51:23,422
This journey wasn't easy,

719
00:51:24,089 --> 00:51:25,716
but I learned...

720
00:51:27,592 --> 00:51:30,846
that you don't have to
erase any part of yourself

721
00:51:30,846 --> 00:51:32,597
in order to love yourself.

722
00:51:36,393 --> 00:51:37,310
Now...

723
00:51:39,438 --> 00:51:40,814
I'm embracing them.

724
00:51:44,735 --> 00:51:46,611
Now, I have accepted them.

725
00:51:50,532 --> 00:51:51,867
Yahoo!

726
00:52:06,965 --> 00:52:09,259
Congratulations!

727
00:52:10,010 --> 00:52:12,262
I'm so happy for you.

728
00:52:16,943 --> 00:52:19,186
Congratulations, everyone!

729
00:52:19,186 --> 00:52:21,521
The event was successful.

730
00:52:22,230 --> 00:52:24,232
I'm really gonna be famous!

731
00:52:25,032 --> 00:52:26,450
I told you,

732
00:52:26,735 --> 00:52:28,028
Belle could do it!

733
00:52:28,028 --> 00:52:30,572
And so could all of us. See?

734
00:52:31,990 --> 00:52:35,035
We were able to do it
because we all came together.

735
00:52:35,786 --> 00:52:36,870
Thank you, Ysa.

736
00:52:37,329 --> 00:52:38,663
You looked after all of us.

737
00:52:40,957 --> 00:52:42,626
Thank Belle, too...

738
00:52:43,710 --> 00:52:45,212
for letting us be a part of her.

739
00:52:46,505 --> 00:52:47,672
You know,

740
00:52:48,548 --> 00:52:51,760
I'm so proud of all of you,
my dear children.

741
00:52:53,053 --> 00:52:55,806
There was a reason
why we were created,

742
00:52:57,098 --> 00:52:58,433
and I'm glad

743
00:52:58,934 --> 00:53:02,020
that we came together
and finally got along.

744
00:53:02,813 --> 00:53:04,940
Now that we've become one...

745
00:53:05,982 --> 00:53:07,400
we're whole,

746
00:53:08,109 --> 00:53:09,277
together.

747
00:53:39,432 --> 00:53:41,184
- Congrats, Belle.
- Congrats, Belle.

748
00:53:41,810 --> 00:53:42,769
Thank you.

749
00:53:45,522 --> 00:53:46,606
Cheers.

750
00:53:47,399 --> 00:53:48,483
Hmm...

751
00:53:50,944 --> 00:53:52,779
So, is it official now?

752
00:53:54,531 --> 00:53:55,740
It's been two months, Ate.

753
00:53:55,740 --> 00:53:57,492
Hey, it's been three months.

754
00:53:58,451 --> 00:53:59,286
Oh, right.

755
00:54:01,705 --> 00:54:03,582
Okay then, lovebirds. Congrats!

756
00:54:04,580 --> 00:54:06,957
Well, even bigger
congratulations to you, Ate.

757
00:54:07,193 --> 00:54:08,861
This is such a huge success.

758
00:54:10,586 --> 00:54:11,879
Thank you, Jayden.

759
00:54:13,133 --> 00:54:15,176
Too bad Nong and Nang
aren't here anymore.

760
00:54:15,485 --> 00:54:17,612
Yeah, they went home early.

761
00:54:17,721 --> 00:54:19,014
They must've gotten tired,

762
00:54:19,014 --> 00:54:21,641
but they said they'll make it up to us
at the blowout tomorrow.

763
00:54:22,183 --> 00:54:24,102
I'm sure this won't be the last one, Ate.

764
00:54:24,257 --> 00:54:25,675
So many people are praising it.

765
00:54:27,355 --> 00:54:28,440
Hmm...

766
00:54:28,582 --> 00:54:30,208
I don't want to think about that yet.

767
00:54:30,233 --> 00:54:32,027
Maybe I should just take
a break for now.

768
00:54:32,961 --> 00:54:33,879
Oh!

769
00:54:33,904 --> 00:54:34,906
Perfect timing.

770
00:54:35,280 --> 00:54:36,865
All you want is a break, Ate?

771
00:54:37,699 --> 00:54:38,450
Well,

772
00:54:38,867 --> 00:54:39,951
maybe this is it.

773
00:55:20,033 --> 00:55:21,117
Hot Americano,

774
00:55:21,660 --> 00:55:22,744
without sugar, ma'am.

775
00:55:28,959 --> 00:55:29,793
Estong.

776
00:55:31,461 --> 00:55:32,414
Hi, Belle.

777
00:55:33,421 --> 00:55:34,506
Congratulations.

778
00:55:37,300 --> 00:55:38,593
When did you get here?

779
00:55:41,137 --> 00:55:42,097
A while ago.

780
00:55:48,311 --> 00:55:49,145
Now...

781
00:55:51,398 --> 00:55:53,316
Now, I have accepted them.

782
00:55:59,531 --> 00:56:00,573
I saw everything.

783
00:56:01,950 --> 00:56:02,826
Surprise.

784
00:56:12,919 --> 00:56:14,754
Looks like it wasn't a break that came,

785
00:56:15,338 --> 00:56:16,965
but fate.

786
00:56:18,258 --> 00:56:19,509
Just like us.

787
00:56:20,260 --> 00:56:21,136
Just like us?

788
00:56:21,477 --> 00:56:24,105
- We're sweeter than them, right?
- Yeah.

789
00:56:24,612 --> 00:56:26,114
Right? Come on, say it.

790
00:56:26,391 --> 00:56:27,225
Give me a kiss.

791
00:56:28,393 --> 00:56:29,978
- Not here.
- Not here?

792
00:56:48,288 --> 00:56:51,499
Hey, I know this. I remember this.

793
00:56:52,542 --> 00:56:53,960
Estongville, right?

794
00:56:56,629 --> 00:56:57,589
It's amazing, right?

795
00:57:00,133 --> 00:57:01,760
It's been years,

796
00:57:02,677 --> 00:57:04,637
but it feels like it was only yesterday.

797
00:57:10,643 --> 00:57:11,728
You know, Estong...

798
00:57:15,732 --> 00:57:18,777
Back then, whenever
a new personality came out...

799
00:57:20,236 --> 00:57:21,363
I got scared.

800
00:57:23,740 --> 00:57:24,574
It's like...

801
00:57:26,951 --> 00:57:28,828
I didn't know myself anymore.

802
00:57:33,750 --> 00:57:34,918
I thought that,

803
00:57:35,752 --> 00:57:38,254
aside from my family and friends...

804
00:57:40,715 --> 00:57:43,676
there would never be a special man
who could accept me and

805
00:57:44,344 --> 00:57:46,221
love me completely.

806
00:57:52,143 --> 00:57:53,728
But when I met you...

807
00:57:57,607 --> 00:57:58,608
turns out, it was true.

808
00:58:00,276 --> 00:58:01,361
There's someone.

809
00:58:03,488 --> 00:58:04,989
Thank you, Estong.

810
00:58:10,745 --> 00:58:12,705
I've proven to myself that

811
00:58:14,249 --> 00:58:17,043
it's enough to have just one person...

812
00:58:20,505 --> 00:58:22,090
who never leaves you,

813
00:58:23,299 --> 00:58:24,884
who's always by your side,

814
00:58:25,301 --> 00:58:26,678
loves you,

815
00:58:27,428 --> 00:58:29,097
and accepts you completely,

816
00:58:30,723 --> 00:58:33,768
along with every version of yourself.

817
00:58:42,068 --> 00:58:43,027
As for me...

818
00:58:45,029 --> 00:58:45,864
well...

819
00:58:47,240 --> 00:58:48,741
When I was in Australia,

820
00:58:51,161 --> 00:58:54,080
I thought I had to go
far away to figure out

821
00:58:54,330 --> 00:58:56,249
what I really wanted in life.

822
00:58:59,377 --> 00:59:02,213
But the farther away I got...

823
00:59:06,134 --> 00:59:08,428
the more I saw you in my plans.

824
00:59:10,388 --> 00:59:12,015
I realized that...

825
00:59:13,391 --> 00:59:15,560
I never needed to fix you,

826
00:59:16,769 --> 00:59:18,855
because there's nothing
wrong with you, Belle.

827
00:59:22,066 --> 00:59:23,693
I just needed to be enough

828
00:59:24,527 --> 00:59:25,612
for you.

829
00:59:26,821 --> 00:59:28,531
I just needed to work on myself.

830
00:59:31,868 --> 00:59:33,745
Looks like you've worked things out, right?

831
00:59:38,695 --> 00:59:40,071
There's one more thing I realized.

832
00:59:41,653 --> 00:59:42,821
My direction.

833
00:59:45,465 --> 00:59:47,508
The direction I'm really heading in,

834
00:59:50,053 --> 00:59:51,137
because...

835
00:59:52,680 --> 00:59:54,974
no matter where I go,

836
00:59:56,845 --> 00:59:59,187
I know I'll always find my way back to you.

837
01:00:02,815 --> 01:00:06,569
I thought I had to find where I'd be happy,

838
01:00:08,584 --> 01:00:09,918
even though

839
01:00:10,615 --> 01:00:12,367
deep down, I always knew...

840
01:00:14,363 --> 01:00:16,407
that I'm happiest when I'm with you.

841
01:00:20,458 --> 01:00:21,626
I love you, Ysabelle.

842
01:00:26,415 --> 01:00:27,333
Estong...

843
01:00:34,097 --> 01:00:36,057
I love you lots.

844
01:01:12,343 --> 01:01:15,054
- Ew! Yucks!
- Yeah!

845
01:01:17,515 --> 01:01:18,391
Ew!

846
01:01:27,032 --> 01:01:28,701
Oh, Lola!

847
01:01:35,366 --> 01:01:38,786
Look at Lola, she's so happy.

848
01:01:43,249 --> 01:01:44,334
You said...

849
01:01:45,126 --> 01:01:46,210
"Love you lots."

850
01:01:46,836 --> 01:01:47,628
So you should...

851
01:01:48,171 --> 01:01:49,422
kiss me lots, too.

852
01:01:49,922 --> 01:01:52,258
Mmm... I already said "I love you lots."

853
01:01:52,592 --> 01:01:54,802
No "kiss me lots?" Come on.
